    \item Are noisy labels easier to find, or the size of their errors easier to estimate, in a hybrid?
    \item Does a hybrid change how well noise mitigation (label correction and cleaning) and noise-robust training perform (Section~\ref{sec:lnl_background})?
\end{enumerate}

